 13). MOD:
+++++++++++



Returns remainder of division

Syntax:
MOD(numerator, denominator)

ex:
details of employee earning even sal.

select *
from emp 
where mod(sal,2)=0;

details of employee earning odd sal

select *
from emp 
where mod(sal,2)!=0;

