17) TRY_CAST
+++++++++++++

Same as CAST but fails safely (returns NULL instead of error)

Syntax:
TRY_CAST(value AS datatype)

EX:

SELECT CAST('ABC' AS NUMBER)
FROM EMP; 

(error) we cannot conver abc as number.

but:


SELECT try_CAST('ABC' AS NUMBER)
FROM EMP; 

(no error only u get null).


18). IFF
++++++++

Simple IF condition function

Syntax:
IFF(condition, true_value, false_value)

ex:

SELECT IFF(5000>3000,'HIGH','LOW');
-- HIGH

SELECT IFF(1000>3000,'HIGH','LOW');
-- LOW

 19. DECODE:
+++++++++++

Multi-condition IF-ELSE alternative

Syntax:
DECODE(expr,
       value1, result1,
       value2, result2,
       default_result)



ex:


-- DECODE
SELECT DECODE(20,
              10,'HR',
              20,'IT',
              'OTHER');
-- HR




SELECT DECODE(2,
              1,'JAN',
              2,'FEB',
              3,'MAR',
              4,'APR',
              'INVALID');
--FEB
              

SELECT DECODE(20,
              10,'HR',
              20,'IT',
              'OTHER');
-- IT

